silm:instances_papers_06_topology_jepa_chapters_01_patch_cover_cocone_sections_03_cocone_assembly_law_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In '03CoconeAssemblyLawYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'The Cocone Assembly Law' the typed_patch_inclusion arrow witnesses the head patch U_head is included into the Mittens diagram image I_Mittens as a typed sub-region preserving the cat-classification node; this typed leg is load-bearing for the cocone assembly step of the topology-JEPA pipeline.; also, In 'The Cocone Assembly Law' the cocone_leg_head arrow witnesses the head local hypothesis emits its cocone leg into the assembled Mittens graph, contributing the cat-classification subgraph; this typed leg is load-bearing for the cocone assembly step of the topology-JEPA pipeline." .
